# ── ephemeral / never approved ────────────────────────────────
scratch/*
!scratch/.gitkeep

# ── non-canonical working files (superseded generators, plan specs) ──
_drafts/

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
~$*
*.swp

# ── python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ── local-only preview state ──────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── kept local: internal working record and draft deliverables ─────
# Client-owned project. memory/ holds working notes and corrections;
# the blueprint is a draft with unfilled placeholders. Add them back
# deliberately if the team needs continuity in the repo.
#
# NARROWED 2026-09-09. This was `*.docx`, which was written for the root
# blueprint below but also caught two RAW SOURCES in research/sources/.
# Both are hashed in research/sources-manifest.json, so the repo declared
# two immutable inputs that could not exist in any clone: the integrity
# check passed on the author's machine and failed in CI, which is the
# only reason it was found. A pattern excluded more than it was aimed at.
memory/
/Luma-Agentic-Design-System-Blueprint.docx

# ── analytics ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Aggregate run records ARE committed (counts only, privacy-checked).
# Raw transcripts must never enter the repo — they hold full conversation content.
*.jsonl
!validation/metrics/*.json
